.git/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler/**
wrangler.toml
wrangler.jsonc
worker/**
*.md

# Dependencies are NEVER assets. Cloudflare builds runs npm install in the
# checkout, and node_modules/workerd alone is 135MB against a 25MB per-asset
# limit. Without these the build dies at the asset-count step and NOTHING
# deploys. Verified 2026-09-26: this pair is the whole reason two publishes
# looked successful and never reached the live site.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Next.js app source (deployed via Vercel, not as Worker assets)
deependhq-next/

# Never ship the source of the redesign staging area or scratch dirs
redesign-*/
.next/
out/
dist/
